Notes on this template repository (rendered output lands in generated projects):

- This repository is a [Copier](https://copier.readthedocs.io/) template.
- Scaffold a new project:

```bash
uvx copier copy gh:EED-Solutions/eed_package_template path/to/new_project
```

- Answer the questions (project name, package name, description, and GitHub org).
- All placeholders (`pyproject` name + scripts, `src/` directory, tests, README, ruleset sources) resolve automatically at copy time.
- After scaffolding: create the repository, push, open a PR, ensure CI passes, import rulesets from `.github/rulesets/` (see the [private guide](https://eed-solutions.atlassian.net/wiki/x/BIA8Mw)), merge, and cut the initial release (e.g., `0.1.0`).

## Updating a generated project to a newer template version

Older projects track their answers in `.copier-answers.yml`; refreshing the improvements:

    copier update

